<title>SPAIN: Spain approves labour reform pact - spokesman.</title>
<headline>Spain approves labour reform pact - spokesman.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain gave on Friday its final approval to a labour reform pact, the spokesman said at the end of the weekly cabinet meeting.</p>
<p>&quot;The government has approved a law that has been called 'the pact for employment,&quot; Miguel Angel Rodriguez, government spokesman said at a press conference.  </p>
<p>Spain's unions and employers signed a final deal on labour reforms at the end of April. The pact aims to liberalise one of Europe's most rigid jobs markets.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
